<title>UK: British retail sales fall 0.3 pct in September.</title>
<headline>British retail sales fall 0.3 pct in September.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>British retail sales fell by 0.3 percent in September from August, the Office for National Statistics said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Sales measured by volume rose by 3.5 percent in the year to September, against a 4.3 percent year-on-year rise in August.</p>
</text>
